    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide</a></i> </p><p>A scaled-down version of a system used in mining and industrial demolitions, these <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Grenades\" title=\"Grenades\">Grenades</a> are programmable for remote detonation using a handheld 100-credit detonator also sold by the manufacturer. Safety features prevent the remote detonation of deployed Remote Grenades within 100 meters of the transmitter, under all circumstances. </p><p>A Remote Grenade has a 2-Square <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Burst\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Burst\">Burst</a> radius. </p><p><b>Special:</b>&nbsp;This is an&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Area_Attack\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Area Attack\">Area Attack</a>&nbsp;Weapon. </p>",
